OL,3,GNEWSAHow anti-migrant boat protests
OL,4,Awere organised and who is behind them
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis weekend saw hundreds of people
OL,7,Ftake part in two anti-migrant protests.
OL,8,FThe men in balaclavas in Dover, and the
OL,9,Fcrowd trying to block the migrant
OL,10,Fcoaches in Portsmouth.
OL,12,FBut how are they linked? The answer is
OL,13,Fone man - Danny Thomas, more often
OL,14,Fknown as Danny Tommo - and some
OL,15,Fapparently poor decision-making by
OL,16,FBorder Force officials.
OL,18,FSaturday's protest in Dover saw men in
OL,19,Fblack clothing and balaclavas block the
OL,20,Ftown's main roads for several hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
