OL,3,GNEWSAHow anti-migrant boat protests
OL,4,Awere organised and who is behind them
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was organised by Thomas - seemingly
OL,7,Fafter weeks of plotting over the summer
OL,8,F- who comes from Hayling Island near
OL,9,FPortsmouth.
